      "url": "https://forums.warframe.com/topic/1172454-warframe-revised-update-2720/",
      "additions": "",
      "changes": "and we would rather players have variety than duplications. In the same way you can\u2019t equip Amalgam Serration and regular Serration, you can\u2019t equip multiple Rivens per weapon, or any duplication of Mods at all, Arcanes will follow. But we are making major changes to the Ranking (up from 3 to 5 with power changes). Instead of having 2 of the same Arcane with a double effect, you can now choose between 2 different Arcanes that behave (generally) at 1.5x efficacy than before.",
